;; Xverse sBTC Bond Staker - canonical lane-0 source
;;
;; A pooled staker for PoX-5 protocol bonds. PoX-5 sees this contract as one
;; staker principal; members hold claims in this ledger. Member sBTC principal
;; lives in the paired treasury whenever PoX-5 does not have custody, while STX
;; is held here because PoX-5 locks the staker principal's own STX.
;;
;; Explicit full-position rollover
;;
;; Initial deposits queue sBTC plus the bound bond's required STX and remain
;; withdrawable until epoch 0 opens. Every later bond requires one explicit
;; full-position commitment per continuing member. A commitment reserves the
;; member's entire existing sats plus any added sats, uses all STX already
;; attributed to the member, and collects only a shortfall. Reservations are
;; first-come-first-served and never partial.
;;
;; At rollover, only explicit commitments enter the new epoch. They receive one
;; share per sat with no proportional scaling. Every member without a consumed
;; commitment is released in full. This keeps rollover accounting binary and
;; prevents one member's deliberate STX top-up from supporting another member.
;;
;; Epoch rewards
;;
;; Each opened bond is an epoch with a frozen share set and reward accumulator.
;; Rewards arrive as bare sBTC transfers to this contract. A prior epoch remains
;; reward-eligible through its delayed final-cycle payout even after positions
;; move. A one-epoch tail stash preserves those claims for members who do not
;; enter the next bond.
;;
;; Lane generation
;;
;; This file is the reviewed lane-0 canonical source. The generated six-lane
;; suite changes only LANE_ID, the paired treasury name, contract names, and
;; network protocol principals. Lane X accepts only bond indexes where
;; index mod 6 = X and retains the same staker principal for future N -> N+6
;; rollovers.
;;
;; Exclusions
;;
;; There is no L1 bridge, BTC-address withdrawal, DAO contract, passive
;; best-effort rollover, partial rollover, STX-only deposit, sponsorship, or
;; cross-lane balance. Users enter and leave with sBTC and STX on Stacks.
;;
;; Adapted from fastpool/sbtc-pool-bond-staker at
;; d8406b725b231d899dfad4d92393422559cd0eda (ISC).

